    "Rates come from the device’s Wi-Fi, Ethernet and cellular interface counters. They may include traffic from other apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rates come from the device’s Wi-Fi, Ethernet and cellular interface counters. They may include traffic from other apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速率来自设备的无线局域网、以太网和蜂窝接口计数器，可能包含其他应用的流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
